    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulo is a 2D physics sandbox game where you can do Anything*. Users can use a variety of in-game tools to build Whatever they could possibly imagine, from simple contraptions like cars to complex machinery. Or, you can just use it to mess around with ragdolls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0*not anything but Almost</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291520/extras/ee1831100438bd22eeef55c6859dcb0b.avif?t=1750628676\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What can I Do with Simulo game?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you open Simulo revolutionary 2D physics sandbox, you will find some of the things you can do include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build machinery and contraptions like cars, pistons, elevators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the electricity components</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mess around with 2D ragdolls, such as humanoids or the Simulo Mascot thing (simulon!!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play around with things made by the community, such as scenes, objects, or even mods and custom tools they made</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you see that Simulo can do Anything (almost). Truly, this game is a true delight indeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here is a thing made entirely with Simulo:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291520/extras/e847bc35441a9f1afbd682b125564d4b.poster.avif?t=1750628676\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291520/extras/e847bc35441a9f1afbd682b125564d4b.webm?t=1750628676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291520/extras/e847bc35441a9f1afbd682b125564d4b.mp4?t=1750628676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why should I be interested in Simulo Game?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this game will Change your Life and is pretty addictive, the testers are playing it all the time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >overall if you Enjoy 2D Sandbox Gaming Experiences this could end up being one of your favorite gamings maybe</p>",
